        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 63,
          "text": "1. Purpose"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 87,
          "text": "This policy defines the methodology used to measure the value of Order Intake for multi-element arrangements. This"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 102,
          "text": "version supersedes v1.0 and introduces a weighted allocation methodology following Q1 2025 internal audit"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 114,
          "text": "recommendations."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 144,
          "text": "2. Scope"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 168,
          "text": "Applies to all multi-element customer arrangements combining:"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 189,
          "text": "- Hardware/Software (HW/SW) deliverables, AND"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 207,
          "text": "- Services deliverables"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 237,
          "text": "3. Definitions"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 261,
          "text": "Standalone Selling Price (SSP): The price at which the Company would sell a deliverable separately under similar"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 276,
          "text": "circumstances."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 294,
          "text": "Weighted Factor: An adjustment factor applied per deliverable category to reflect margin and risk differences,"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 309,
          "text": "determined annually by the Pricing Committee."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 336,
          "text": "4. Roles and Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "table",
          "top": 360.0,
          "rows": [
            [
              "Role",
              "Responsibility"
            ],
            [
              "Deal Desk",
              "Prepares Relative SSP allocation calculations"
            ],
            [
              "Regional Finance Head",
              "Reviews allocations exceeding threshold (elevated from Finance Manager)"
            ],
            [
              "Pricing Committee",
              "Determines annual Weighted Factors"
            ]
          ],
          "n_rows": 4,
          "n_cols": 2
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 456,
          "text": "5. SSP Allocation Methodology"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 483,
          "text": "5.1 Calculation Basis"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 504,
          "text": "Allocation is performed using the Relative SSP method, under which a Weighted Factor is applied per deliverable"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 519,
          "text": "category. This replaces the unweighted Standalone List Price method used in v1.0."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 543,
          "text": "5.2 Weighted Factor Determination"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 564,
          "text": "The Weighted Factor is determined annually by the Pricing Committee based on:"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 582,
          "text": "- Historical margin performance by deliverable category"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 600,
          "text": "- Delivery risk profile"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 618,
          "text": "- Market comparables"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 645,
          "text": "5.3 Allocation Formula"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 663,
          "text": "Step 1 — Relative SSP: Relative SSP = SSP × Weighted Factor"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 684,
          "text": "Step 2 — SSP Allocation: SSP Allocation = (Relative SSP ÷ Total Relative SSP) × Total Contract Value"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 702,
          "text": "Step 3 — Variance Check: SSP % from Contract Value = (SSP Allocation - Proportional Contract Value) ÷"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 717,
          "text": "Proportional Contract Value × 100"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 750,
          "text": "CFO POLICY FRAMEWORK | CONTROLLED DOCUMENT Page 2"
        }
      ]
    },
