          "text": "Factors are published annually by the Pricing Committee."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 210,
          "text": "7. Approval Requirements"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 234,
          "text": "Allocations resulting in variance greater than 10% from Relative SSP require Regional Finance Head sign-off prior to"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 249,
          "text": "booking."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 273,
          "text": "CONTROL ENHANCEMENT"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 297,
          "text": "Threshold reduced from 20% to 10%; approval authority elevated from Finance Manager to Regional Finance"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 309,
          "text": "Head."
        },
        {
